<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plague</i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.61
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.171
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιμοῦ σκηπτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					715
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); of the plague at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.47
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				201d
			</span></i>: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				188b
			</span></i>, al.; coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
			</span></i> and Hdt.ll.cc., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.54
			</span></i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.135
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>plague, pest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.80
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adj., <i>pestilent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ λ. καὶ πονηρός</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				30.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				24.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sm.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					20.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
